# Root-only absolute-path component capsule

Prepared only; no wrapper, seal, GDScript parser, engine or native test was executed by the preparer. Original component draft, PLAN.md and READINESS.json remain byte-identical. Root alone may promote this additive corrected inert source after reviewing this capsule.

The corrected source changes only two report-path guards from user:// to `is_absolute_path()` and their explanatory message, plus passive portrait observations unsupported by the inherited JSON encoder: Transform3D is now its identical basis+origin components, and Vector2i viewport size is now its identical x/y integer array. All eligibility, construction, proof, input, assertions, cadence, cleanup and count behavior stays exactly the original draft.

The actual public Ray state/lease and Canal encounter receipts consist of dictionaries/arrays/scalars plus Vector3; Scheduler/Ray/Lane/Player actor snapshots are already closed JSON. The inherited encoder handles Vector3, Vector2, Rect2 and Basis recursively. All observed instance identities are strings or the inherited explicit large-integer diagnostic representation. The portrait's former Transform3D and Vector2i were the only unsupported passive observation values identified in this source review. This is not a runtime type proof or parser/native pass.

Root's proposed private executable is `.cinder/a2-o3-difficulty-20261015/component-prepare/absolute-v2/act2_o3_arrangement_component.gd`, copied byte-for-byte from the same-name `.gd.txt`. The wrapper refuses different executable/draft bytes. No public test alias or production edit is needed. It seals 26 explicitly named component/native/tooling inputs, genuine existing named UID bytes, original/corrected private records and its own fixed capsule. This is a named subset, not transitive closure or a global UID census. The private component UID may be absent for explicit script loading; if present at seal, its observed bytes are frozen thereafter. No import is requested or inferred.

Proposed Root commands, after the separate current Shell job is CLOSED:

```sh
cp '.cinder/a2-o3-difficulty-20261015/component-prepare/absolute-v2/act2_o3_arrangement_component.gd.txt' '.cinder/a2-o3-difficulty-20261015/component-prepare/absolute-v2/act2_o3_arrangement_component.gd'
python3 .cinder/a2-o3-difficulty-20261015/component-prepare/absolute-v2/run_component.py seal
